# armour/shared/pauldron_pelt5_r: the great PELT pauldron on the right shoulder (pelt.5; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a beast's pelt grown great over the shoulder and the collar: dark hide with lit fur in 2-4 px tufts, its foot
# ragged in tufts (the MANTLE mass).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: P the lit tufts.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron pelt.5
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

